WEBVTT

00:00.900 --> 00:03.350
Give up on the Ring of Wind?!

00:04.040 --> 00:09.420
The Abyss King's armies 
could be closing in as we speak.

00:09.420 --> 00:12.990
We can't afford to delay here any longer.

00:13.400 --> 00:14.410
But...

00:14.730 --> 00:16.590
We're not giving up.

00:16.590 --> 00:18.280
We're just putting it off.

00:18.280 --> 00:23.620
Right now you need to obtain the most 
rings in the least amount of time.

00:23.980 --> 00:29.240
As it stands, you can't even 
defeat a knight of the Abyss King.

00:29.900 --> 00:32.470
That... may be true, but...

00:34.580 --> 00:37.680
Are you... worried about that princess?

00:38.090 --> 00:39.080
Well, yeah.

00:39.820 --> 00:43.320
She kind of got put through 
the wringer because of me.

00:48.320 --> 00:50.150
They're finally leaving.

00:50.520 --> 00:52.300
The story of the Ring King

00:52.300 --> 00:57.160
is a tale so old and musty even we 
long-lived elves don't know the truth of it.

00:57.160 --> 01:01.420
The people who live here now 
are the ones I should protect.

01:01.420 --> 01:02.580
Jade-sama!

01:03.000 --> 01:04.460
What is it?

01:04.460 --> 01:05.500
Bad news!

01:05.500 --> 01:09.400
Abyss monsters have made it 
past the tempest wall!

01:09.400 --> 01:10.380
What?!

01:11.290 --> 01:14.470
We've received word that a powerful monster 
has opened a hole in the barrier!

01:14.810 --> 01:18.280
Its sending its subordinate monsters 
through a few at time!

01:18.720 --> 01:20.760
A hole in the barrier?!

01:20.760 --> 01:24.430
No monster could get through 
the barrier my parents erected!

01:24.830 --> 01:28.840
We've also received word there are even 
more monsters lurking outside the barrier!

01:34.160 --> 01:35.440
What's that?

01:35.440 --> 01:37.240
An Abyss monster?!

01:37.240 --> 01:38.160
Huh?!

01:40.490 --> 01:41.840
How?!

01:41.840 --> 01:44.200
I thought they had their tempest wall?

01:44.570 --> 01:45.990
It's heading toward...

01:46.930 --> 01:48.180
the palace?!

01:48.870 --> 01:51.400
We're turning back, Satou-kun!

01:51.400 --> 01:53.210
We must protect the rings!

01:53.210 --> 01:54.150
Yeah!

01:55.300 --> 01:57.060
Then, Satou...

03:34.300 --> 03:35.820
Fire! Fire!

03:40.790 --> 03:42.410
How can this be?!

03:44.360 --> 03:46.910
Monsters have passed through the barrier.

03:46.910 --> 03:49.370
Are you content to do nothing?

03:50.360 --> 03:52.980
My brother will do something about them.

03:53.880 --> 03:56.360
There's nothing I can even do.

03:57.290 --> 04:02.200
I promised my Mother I would stay put here.

04:05.560 --> 04:09.900
If you feel that way, then just
turn yourself to stone right there.

04:10.400 --> 04:14.310
An elf who's killed 
their heart has no life to live.

04:29.290 --> 04:32.000
So you are after the Wind Ring?

04:32.280 --> 04:35.370
You're planning to use the chaos 
to completely eliminate the barrier

04:35.370 --> 04:38.460
and let the large army outside invade?

04:39.920 --> 04:41.090
I won't let you!

04:52.530 --> 04:57.560
So this... is the Abyss King's knight 
that attacked Nokanatika?!

04:58.900 --> 05:01.930
Still! I cannot back down!

05:02.400 --> 05:06.160
I must protect

05:06.760 --> 05:10.070
my parents' legacy!

05:19.890 --> 05:21.610
We made it in time!

05:22.440 --> 05:23.770
Ring King!

05:23.770 --> 05:24.750
You!

05:24.750 --> 05:26.380
Why have you returned?!

05:26.720 --> 05:29.820
Just so you know, it wasn't for your sake.

05:30.260 --> 05:32.350
It's because this is her home.

05:34.600 --> 05:37.600
I couldn't do anything to stop it last time,

05:37.600 --> 05:39.520
but this time I will!

05:39.520 --> 05:42.170
I have plenty of power now!

05:42.930 --> 05:45.240
Keep your eyes forward! Forward!

05:45.240 --> 05:49.030
If you fall here, then there's 
no future for this world.

05:49.470 --> 05:51.450
Be careful not to be too reckless.

05:51.880 --> 05:52.700
Yeah!

05:52.700 --> 05:55.040
As long as I can drive it off, 
it's a job well done!

05:55.600 --> 05:56.870
Fools...

06:00.040 --> 06:01.960
Their swords won't scratch it,

06:01.960 --> 06:04.960
and there's no way they can 
cancel out all of its magic.

06:05.910 --> 06:08.440
They're facing it without 
any hope of victory.

06:08.840 --> 06:11.080
Satou knows that.

06:12.070 --> 06:16.100
But no matter how powerful 
or scary the opponent is,

06:16.100 --> 06:18.840
Satou will still protect me.

06:19.650 --> 06:21.740
The same goes for me.

06:25.300 --> 06:27.210
I'll protect my little sister.

06:27.210 --> 06:30.740
It's all I've lived for 
ever since we swore that oath.

06:30.740 --> 06:33.020
I have to protect Nefritis!

06:33.020 --> 06:36.180
From the fate of the rings!

06:40.950 --> 06:44.500
I knew it would be, but this is tough.

06:45.100 --> 06:48.700
I thought I would fare a little better.

06:55.540 --> 06:56.850
Hime?

06:57.970 --> 06:59.340
It's nothing.

06:59.880 --> 07:01.380
Be careful, okay?

07:11.620 --> 07:13.430
I'm not good enough.

07:14.200 --> 07:15.630
Not on my own.

07:16.550 --> 07:18.870
Hime! Back away!

07:35.650 --> 07:36.880
Nefritis.

07:36.880 --> 07:39.530
It's me, Krystal.

07:43.400 --> 07:47.730
Well, Satou-kun, we should retreat for now.

07:48.920 --> 07:50.570
That's impossible.

07:50.920 --> 07:53.680
It's after the Wind Ring,

07:53.680 --> 07:56.030
so we can't abandon this spot.

07:56.610 --> 07:57.660
Ring King!

07:57.930 --> 08:01.100
The Maiden of the Ring of Light 
went to summon Nefritis!

08:01.100 --> 08:02.110
Hime has?!

08:02.110 --> 08:03.170
Why would she—

08:03.170 --> 08:06.340
It's all out of concern for you.

08:06.880 --> 08:08.870
You have a good wife.

08:12.160 --> 08:14.150
We have to hold out a while longer!

08:17.190 --> 08:18.720
Please...

08:18.720 --> 08:20.660
Marry Satou!

08:23.540 --> 08:25.910
It's our first time 
having a proper chat, huh?

08:26.520 --> 08:29.020
I hope it's okay to speak casually like this.

08:29.470 --> 08:31.490
If you don't like it, tell me.

08:34.960 --> 08:37.120
You know, both of my parents...

08:37.120 --> 08:40.740
also lost their lives 
protecting me and the rings.

08:42.930 --> 08:45.500
Protecting the rings 
and those who inherit them...

08:46.000 --> 08:49.640
I know how heavy that duty 
can weigh on a person.

08:50.450 --> 08:55.760
I also... felt how powerless I was, 
unable to do anything but be protected.

08:57.220 --> 09:04.770
My father and mother sacrificed 
their lives to create the wind barrier.

09:05.200 --> 09:08.570
All so I wouldn't have to inherit the rings!

09:09.740 --> 09:12.760
I have to honor their wishes.

09:13.240 --> 09:16.550
I'm... not like you.

09:17.410 --> 09:20.090
You're right, you aren't like me.

09:20.960 --> 09:21.950
But...

09:22.410 --> 09:25.070
that's why you can protect everyone!

09:25.070 --> 09:27.210
You're not like I was back then!

09:27.760 --> 09:29.800
Everyone is fighting!

09:29.800 --> 09:32.590
Your brother, the Elder, everyone...

09:32.590 --> 09:35.720
Even though the Abyss King's 
knight is really strong!

09:36.170 --> 09:37.590
That's...

09:38.160 --> 09:41.230
because doing so is the responsibility 
of those who bear the rings.

09:41.230 --> 09:42.250
No!

09:43.160 --> 09:47.310
Satou is fighting to protect your home!

09:47.900 --> 09:49.960
That's what he's fighting for!

09:49.960 --> 09:51.770
Satou-sama is...?

09:52.120 --> 09:55.980
I know Satou's weird, but he's really nice,

09:55.980 --> 10:00.390
so I'm sure he'll fight until the last 
minute, even though it might kill him.

10:01.190 --> 10:05.070
I can't do anything else anymore...

10:05.070 --> 10:07.920
I hate to admit it, 
but I'm not enough on my own!

10:08.330 --> 10:11.050
Please! Save Satou!

10:11.470 --> 10:14.340
Marry Satou!

10:24.520 --> 10:28.040
Can I actually do that?

10:38.530 --> 10:40.990
Hime! Nefritis!

10:40.990 --> 10:42.760
Nefritis?

10:42.760 --> 10:44.330
Why are you here?

10:44.670 --> 10:48.960
Brother... please scold me later.

10:49.280 --> 10:51.850
You're really sure, right?

10:52.200 --> 10:53.100
Yes!

10:54.010 --> 10:55.130
What are you?!

11:00.320 --> 11:02.160
Father, Mother,

11:02.160 --> 11:03.610
I'm sorry!

11:14.930 --> 11:17.400
The wind barrier is fading!

11:17.400 --> 11:19.130
How can this be?!

11:21.410 --> 11:22.820
Satou-sama!

11:49.350 --> 11:50.510
This is bad!

11:50.510 --> 11:53.650
Without the barrier, 
the army of monsters will—

11:54.040 --> 11:55.430
It's all right.

11:55.830 --> 12:00.340
With both Satou-sama's 
Ring of Wind and Ring of Light...

12:27.200 --> 12:28.570
Wow...

12:29.010 --> 12:31.100
Now, Satou-kun!

12:31.100 --> 12:32.170
Yeah!

12:37.040 --> 12:39.610
<i>I can manipulate the wind as I will?!</i>

13:00.340 --> 13:03.090
Hime, Nefritis?

13:04.560 --> 13:05.620
I...

13:11.060 --> 13:12.770
You're awake?

13:14.550 --> 13:18.220
You proved worthy of being 
chosen by the Ring of Light.

13:18.220 --> 13:21.400
You were able to draw out 
plenty of the ring's power.

13:27.990 --> 13:29.560
Ring King.

13:30.030 --> 13:34.940
Today, you saved our nation of 
Romca from the threat of the Abyss King.

13:35.370 --> 13:40.340
Allow me to thank you on behalf of 
Romca's princess, Nefritis Romca.

13:40.730 --> 13:43.550
Wh-Who is this?!

13:43.550 --> 13:48.650
This is woman is the elder sister 
of the previous Queen Romca,

13:48.650 --> 13:50.640
Princess Smaragdi.

13:50.640 --> 13:52.720
Y-You mean the one who left this country

13:52.720 --> 13:56.350
after losing her lover 
because of the ring long ago?

13:56.350 --> 13:58.560
What is she doing here?!

13:58.920 --> 14:00.910
You don't remember?

14:00.910 --> 14:05.030
The face beneath the mask 
of the Abyss King's knight?

14:09.890 --> 14:14.980
The true identity of the Abyss King's 
knight was the old ring princess?

14:15.450 --> 14:16.630
Look.

14:19.430 --> 14:21.400
A Black Ring of Wind?

14:21.850 --> 14:24.360
Apparently she was controlled by this.

14:24.360 --> 14:27.130
Though it's lost its power now.

14:29.580 --> 14:33.210
I cursed my destiny to inherit the rings,

14:33.210 --> 14:35.810
and the world that forced it upon me.

14:36.530 --> 14:40.700
He took advantage of that 
ugliness in my heart.

14:44.660 --> 14:46.780
Take the ring.

14:49.080 --> 14:53.580
I'll save you from your suffering.

14:59.860 --> 15:04.420
Is there so little known 
about the Abyss King?!

15:05.390 --> 15:10.620
We only know it was said that after 
the legendary battle with the Ring King,

15:10.620 --> 15:16.060
he lost his body and his soul was sealed 
away in Vanna, the land to the far north.

15:16.460 --> 15:19.470
However, even if no one has seen him,

15:19.470 --> 15:22.970
the Abyss King's minions 
are attacking people.

15:22.970 --> 15:26.900
And his black rings give birth 
to the Abyss King's knights.

15:27.360 --> 15:30.740
The threat he poses is certainly real.

15:31.800 --> 15:33.320
I see...

15:33.840 --> 15:37.490
Then we'll have to gather the rings 
quickly and put a stop to him.

15:38.030 --> 15:39.410
Satou!

15:40.690 --> 15:42.760
I'm feeling kind of dizzy.

15:42.760 --> 15:45.920
You just used a lot of the rings' power.

15:45.920 --> 15:48.590
A normal king would be dead already.

15:48.590 --> 15:51.050
You got off as easily as you did

15:51.050 --> 15:54.500
because you were protected by 
your bonds with two princesses.

15:54.990 --> 15:56.550
Be grateful to them.

15:56.860 --> 16:00.270
<i>Two princesses? I see...</i>

16:00.740 --> 16:02.970
<i>I actually married one, huh?</i>

16:03.500 --> 16:05.480
<i>A princess other than Hime.</i>

16:06.220 --> 16:07.750
<i>But I...</i>

16:08.800 --> 16:09.820
Nefritis...

16:09.820 --> 16:11.520
Satou-sama!

16:11.520 --> 16:14.940
We have a spring with healing 
properties in the palace!

16:14.940 --> 16:16.090
Let's go visit it!

16:16.090 --> 16:18.170
I'm sure you'll feel better in no time!

16:31.120 --> 16:33.680
What's going on here?

16:34.090 --> 16:35.100
Yes.

16:35.510 --> 16:40.330
I'm aware that you two are already 
bound by deep love for each other.

16:40.330 --> 16:42.810
So since you became 
his wife first, Krystal-sama,

16:42.810 --> 16:45.900
I'd like you to teach me 
how to be a good wife!

16:45.900 --> 16:46.780
Wha?!

16:47.600 --> 16:49.630
Oh, I see.

16:49.630 --> 16:53.200
Well, Satou and I both understand 
everything about each other!

16:53.200 --> 16:55.360
We've also kissed plenty of times!

16:55.360 --> 16:56.660
Plenty of times?!

16:56.660 --> 17:00.740
And of course, when it comes to nightly 
love-making, we do it every night!

17:00.740 --> 17:01.450
Huh?!

17:01.450 --> 17:02.500
Every night...

17:02.960 --> 17:05.500
Oh? I see.

17:05.500 --> 17:08.330
Then why don't you show us?

17:08.330 --> 17:10.880
Show us how you two make love!

17:10.880 --> 17:12.090
Huh?!

17:13.250 --> 17:17.210
I've lain with people from this 
world many times before,

17:17.210 --> 17:19.510
but I imagine a man from another world

17:19.510 --> 17:23.720
might go about it differently, 
even if it seems similar.

17:24.520 --> 17:26.670
This is a great chance!

17:26.670 --> 17:29.400
I'm happy to observe carefully 
from the sidelines.

17:29.400 --> 17:31.320
Go on, go on.

17:31.320 --> 17:32.490
Go on.

17:32.490 --> 17:33.480
Go on, go on.

17:36.500 --> 17:38.320
Watch, Nefritis.

17:39.450 --> 17:40.580
Hime?!

17:42.230 --> 17:44.230
Huh? Hime!

17:51.260 --> 17:53.600
This is your chance, Satou.

17:53.600 --> 17:57.670
I can't back down now...

18:03.720 --> 18:05.140
Wait, Hime!

18:06.640 --> 18:12.360
I don't want us to be 
pressured into it like this!

18:13.400 --> 18:14.300
Oh-ho?

18:23.590 --> 18:26.440
If you're the one they call the sage,

18:26.440 --> 18:28.390
then perhaps you might know?

18:28.930 --> 18:33.690
About the traveler 
that visited here 50 years ago?

18:34.460 --> 18:36.550
The man I loved...

18:37.160 --> 18:39.100
Was he killed?

18:39.100 --> 18:40.760
Or did he flee and survive?

18:47.230 --> 18:48.330
That's...

18:48.330 --> 18:50.540
That's the gift I gave to him!

18:51.120 --> 18:52.980
Why do you have it?

18:53.510 --> 18:57.820
I've known him for a long time.

18:57.820 --> 19:00.410
Is he alive?!

19:00.780 --> 19:03.800
This is what he told me:

19:03.800 --> 19:07.900
"I couldn't bear to see the woman I loved

19:07.900 --> 19:10.290
ostracized because of me."

19:11.730 --> 19:15.320
He now lives a peaceful life 
in a land far from here.

19:17.460 --> 19:19.720
Does he now?

19:20.470 --> 19:25.640
He's always wished for your happiness.

19:25.640 --> 19:29.180
I'm glad I got this chance to tell you.

19:42.900 --> 19:46.060
Father, Mother.

19:47.490 --> 19:52.310
We'll be watching over you 
until you grow stronger.

19:53.840 --> 19:56.520
I'll be fine now.

19:57.530 --> 20:00.900
Plus, I've found something I want to do.

20:02.550 --> 20:03.810
You're going?

20:03.810 --> 20:05.430
Brother.

20:06.720 --> 20:08.950
Yes, I'm going.

20:11.410 --> 20:15.830
You've grown strong, Nef.

20:20.290 --> 20:22.260
Satou-sama!

20:24.710 --> 20:26.090
Nefritis?

20:28.180 --> 20:29.400
Are you sure?

20:29.400 --> 20:30.570
Yes.

20:30.570 --> 20:35.960
It's the duty of a Ring Princess to stay at 
the Ring King's side and offer him strength.

20:35.960 --> 20:37.580
Plus...

20:37.580 --> 20:41.460
I want to see many places 
in the outside world.

20:41.840 --> 20:45.680
And one day, I want to go to your world, too!

20:46.170 --> 20:48.390
You promised me, right?

20:48.390 --> 20:51.500
Satou, you made her a promise like that?

20:51.500 --> 20:53.810
Huh? Oh, yeah.

20:54.110 --> 20:55.930
Hey!

20:56.630 --> 20:58.820
Oh, Satou, you!

21:01.890 --> 21:07.660
Do you think the Ring Princess 
will find happiness this time, Elder?

21:08.200 --> 21:11.870
Or rather... 
one of the original Ring Princesses,

21:13.240 --> 21:14.740
Peridot-sama.

21:15.890 --> 21:21.900
All of the Ring Princesses 
that I've seen have never fared well.

21:22.450 --> 21:24.730
That includes the original ring princesses.

21:25.840 --> 21:30.680
The new Ring King 
is a bit too meek for a king,

21:30.680 --> 21:35.060
but perhaps that will prove 
a good thing for them.

21:37.970 --> 21:40.120
The Ring King has left?

21:40.120 --> 21:42.980
Yeah, he's probably 
past Romca's borders by now.

21:42.980 --> 21:44.570
I see.

21:44.570 --> 21:47.780
I wanted to try chatting 
with the great sage, Alabaster.

21:48.850 --> 21:50.240
Alabaster?!

21:50.920 --> 21:52.340
That man was my—

21:57.960 --> 21:59.600
What's wrong, old man?

21:59.600 --> 22:02.440
Oh, it's nothing.

22:03.290 --> 22:06.970
Come on, come on. If we don't hurry, 
we'll be sleeping under the stars.

22:06.970 --> 22:08.500
Yeah, yeah.
